{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "2398339b-8965-8acc-a03f-92c5c46498fb",
  "created_at": "2026-02-10T10:00:10-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Erin McCarthy",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:58:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise, good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:58:06-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Yes. Good morning. This is Erin McCarthy. I'm, um, I'm a landlord. I own a couple of rental units here in town."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:58:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Ms. McCarthy, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:58:19-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well. The trash. They didn't take it. [pause] That's the second time in a row now. Two weeks, nobody took it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:58:27-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry about that. Two pickups in a row missed, got it. Was the barrel out at the curb early, before the usual time?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:58:36-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh yes. The tenants put it out the night before. Both times. [line breaks up] ...and it just sat there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:58:44-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You broke up a little there. Can you say that again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:58:49-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I said it sat there, both times. Full. And, um. [pause] I also have an old stove. In the cellar. A tenant left it. How would I get rid of that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:59:00-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Big appliances usually aren't picked up with regular trash. There's typically a separate bulky item arrangement, and I'd have to have our sanitation staff confirm how it works for a stove."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:59:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. So that would be the, what was it, the sanitary department?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:59:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sanitation. It's part of Public Works, so you're in the right place."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:59:21-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The sanitarium? Is that a different office? I'm sorry, the line is not good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:59:27-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no. Sanitation. Same building, same department as me. I'll just put the notes in for both of them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:59:34-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, good. Good. [pause] Now where was I. The stove. Yes. And the trash."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:59:40-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. I'll log the missed pickup, and I'll have someone call you about the stove. What's the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:59:47-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0168."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:59:49-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero one six eight. And I'll need the street address for the missed pickup, so they know which barrel."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:59:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[line breaks up] Oh. I'd rather, um. I'll give it to them when they call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:00:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, I'll note that. Someone will call you back. Thanks for calling, Ms. McCarthy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T10:00:08-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, dear. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
